# .gitconfig-work — Work identity overlay
#
# NOT read on its own. ~/.gitconfig pulls it in via [includeIf] for repos that
# belong to the rased-org GitHub org (or live under ~/Development/work/), so
# work commits are authored with the work address while everything else stays
# on the personal one. See the "Work identity" section at the bottom of
# .gitconfig. link.sh symlinks this to ~/.gitconfig-work.
#
# Verify inside any repo with: git whoami
